  Here's another weird way to rob shops which I discovered the other day.
As always, since this is somewhat of a spoiler, here is the mandatory...






  The drawback to this method is that you have to have enough gold to buy
the stuff - you just don't have to spend it.  It gets the shopkeeper angry,
but could come in useful.
  Drop a sack 'o gold on the square right inside the shop entrance, and any
gold inside will get converted to store credit.  Go around and pick up lots
of stuff, which will be counted against your credit.  When you pick up the
sack again, the credit is cancelled, and the items revert to unpaid status.
However, since you are right next to the shop exit, you can just hightail
it out of there with your new load of funstuff!  



